# The measured revision of the timing-v2 campaigns (`benchmarks/campaign-tcbench.yaml`
# and `benchmarks/campaign-per-shape.yaml`).
#
# `tcontract-rs` main at the revision that carries the timing-v2 evidence contract for
# both harnesses: 953a2ff9 landed the `tcbench` contract (tensor4all/tcontract-rs#127)
# and 7738bf43 the `lukbench` one (tensor4all/tcontract-rs#128), which is this commit.
#
# Kept apart from `pins/tcontract-rs.rev` (the legacy timing-v1 reference) on purpose:
# moving that pin would make the committed legacy `result/INDEX.md` stale, and the
# historical evidence and pages stay where they are.
# main (61a04eb) from 2026-10-19: the newest revision, five commits past the previous
# pin. The last release tag v0.2.1 (eff101a) is seven commits *behind* the previous
# pin, so pinning the tag would have been a downgrade.
# `v0.6.0` (71a11a8) from 2026-10-27: the release on crates.io deps (tcontract-exec 0.6, threadteam 0.1,
